  * New upstream release 1.4.0, now at codeberg.org/unf/vdr-plugin-text2skin,
    contains all former patches: HD skins scaled to the OSD size, true
    colour mode, Lanczos scaling and dithering, copies of channel, event
    and recording data, no waiting for VDR's lists in the update thread,
