vdr-plugin-text2skin (1.3.4+git20170702-5fnu0~trixie) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Logos keep their colours in palette mode (no filter without colour
    reduction), complete frames for animations, 16 to 8 bit dithering
  * Copies of channel, event and recording data instead of VDR's pointers
    (use after free), the update thread never waits for VDR's lists
    (VDR could hang when a timer started with the menu open)
  * Aspect ratio and language tokens for H.264, HEVC, AC-3, HE-AAC, AC-4
  * Skip reruns without event or on unknown channels (crashed)
  * Requires VDR 2.4, GraphicsMagick default, README updated
  * contains following patches:
    -hd-skins-scale-to-osd.patch
    -lanczos-image-scaling.patch
    -free-recording-time-from-vdr.patch
    -true-colour-mode.patch
    -copy-only-drawn-windows.patch
    -palette-scaling-without-filter.patch
    -coalesce-animations.patch
    -dither-16-to-8-bit.patch
    -copy-display-data.patch
    -skip-invalid-reruns.patch
    -never-wait-for-vdr-lists.patch
    -video-audio-components.patch
    -require-vdr-2.4.patch

